[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2584153\">1004D10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585279\">1004D40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585288\">1020A24</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and the nut (1b) and remove the water pump\n(1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2022116.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2584153\">1004D10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585279\">1004D40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585288\">1020A24</a></p><p>1. Undo the retaining bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the engine oil pump (2a) complete with draught element\n(2b).</p><p>3. Recover the oil pump gasket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2022263.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Fit the crankshaft gear lock (1a) as shown.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.744.000</p></td></tr></table></div><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Work with flywheel retainer 1860846000\nfitted.</p></aside><p>2. Unscrew the bolt securing the crankshaft gear and remove.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2022117.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Replace the oil pump gasket.</p><p>Position the oil pump fitting the drive\nshaft in its housing.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the oil pump to\nthe cylinder block/crankcase to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>ENGINE OIL PUMP</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2585288\">1020A24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585279\">1004D40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584153\">1004D10</a></p>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Undo bolts (1a) and remove engine block lower cover (1b) with\nbuilt-in oil pump, complete with crankshaft lower oil seal(1c),\nintake duct (1d) and oil filter (1e).</p><p>2. Remove engine block lower seal</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2022118.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position a new gasket on the oil pump.</p><p>Fit the crankcase front cover with built\nin oil pump complete intake housing and oil filter and secure by tightening\nbolts to the recomended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>ENGINE OIL PUMP</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1</p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Fit a new crankshaft front cover oil seal (1a) using the tool\n(1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.903.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2022119.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Fit the gear on the crankshaft.</p><p>2. Fit the crankshaft locking tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.744.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Secure the crankshaft gear by tightening the bolt to the specified\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>TOOTHED DRIVE PULLEY</p></td><td><p>M11</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2 + 90°</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2022120.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Apply the recommended sealent to the outside\nedge of the water pump in one continuous line.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Ensure there is a good join between\nboth ends.</p></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Silicon sealant</p></td><td><p>COOLANT PUMP</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the water pump and fix it tightening\nthe nuts and bolts to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT PUMP</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>COOLANT PUMP</p></td><td><p>M6 x 1</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.7</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2585288\">1020A24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585279\">1004D40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584153\">1004D10</a></p>"]]